--- task
id: a10
dataset: attribution
kind: count per value of a property
answer: fewest

--- intent
How many touchpoints are there of each action? Return the action and the count as `n`.

--- edition2
query per_action() {
  match { $t: Touchpoint }
  return { $t.action, count($t) as n }
}

--- edition3
query per_action() {
  match { $t: Touchpoint }
  return { $t.action, count($t) as n }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["t.action","n"]
["star",8]
["fork",3]
